    "chunk_text": "Iohannes \u00fea geseah \u00fe\u00e6t he s\u00e6t ablicged, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft \u00feus to: Ic bidde \u00e6t \u00fee nu \u00fe\u00e6s iungan \u00d0a begann se ealda incu\u00f0lice siccettan & mid wope wear\u00f0 witodlice ofergoten, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Iohanne: \u00d0a befran Iohannes f\u00e6rlice, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hu ys he la dead o\u00f0\u00f0e hwilcum dea\u00f0e? He cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft \u00feus to andsware: He is Gode dead, for \u00fean \u00fee he leahterfull & geleafleas \u00e6tb\u00e6rst, Hw\u00e6t, \u00fea Iohannes mid orm\u00e6tre geomerunge cwehte his heafod, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam bisceope: Godne & man him sona funde, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he frimdig w\u00e6s, & he fram \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean sona swi\u00f0e efste, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00d0a gel\u00e6hton \u00fea weardmen his wealdle\u00f0er f\u00e6ste, \u00fe\u00e6t he mid fleame huru ne \u00e6tburste; ac he nolde Hig clipodon \u00fea mid \u00feam \u00feone cniht him ra\u00f0e to, \u00fee hira heafodman w\u00e6s, & he com \u00fea gew\u00e6mnod, Iohannes \u00f0a heow \u00fe\u00e6t hors mid \u00feam spuran & wear\u00f0 him \u00e6fterweard & his ylde ne gimde, clypode Hwi flihst \u00f0u \u00feisne ealdan & ungew\u00e6pnodan? Ne ondr\u00e6d \u00fee la earming; git \u00feu h\u00e6fst lifes hiht. Ic wille agildan gescead for \u00feinre sawle Criste & ic lustlice wille min lif for \u00fee syllan, swa swa se \u00c6tstand huru nu, & gehyr \u00feas word, & gelyf \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend me asende to \u00fee. \u00dea \u00e6tstod",
